From: raghavt20 <raghavt20@aospa.co>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 09:36:34 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 09/11] Disable parallel processing

Sweet's config enables parallel (algo up) processing, which creates
sessions on the vendor.xiaomi.hardware.campostproc service through
libmicampostproc_client. Violet's MIUI 12.5 vendor has no such service,
so MiPostProcSessionIntf::initialize() dereferences null and the camera
crashes as soon as it opens.
---
 smali_classes2/com/mi/device/Sweet.smali | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/smali_classes2/com/mi/device/Sweet.smali b/smali_classes2/com/mi/device/Sweet.smali
index edc538e..a3ce382 100644
--- a/smali_classes2/com/mi/device/Sweet.smali
+++ b/smali_classes2/com/mi/device/Sweet.smali
@@ -900,7 +900,7 @@
 .method public o0O00O0o()Z
     .locals 0
 
-    const/4 p0, 0x1
+    const/4 p0, 0x0
 
     return p0
 .end method
